        {
          "id": "afcbe236-b9df-4b4e-9007-f7835dbb5d5a",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Текст",
          "value": "<h3>Чаты сообщества</h3>",
          "settings": {
            "anchor": "",
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "321ea7c6-3795-4f73-9b92-cb170e8f66dd",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Текст",
          "value": "<p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\" pm-open-left=\"1\"><b>«Расписание»</b> — информация о расписании на неделю, об изменениях, а также напоминания о вебинарах.</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\"><b>«FAQ»</b> — тема с ответами на часто задаваемые вопросы и информацией, которая позволит вам быстрее адаптироваться к обучению.</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\"><b>«Вопрос-ответ»</b> — задавайте вопросы команде поддержки.</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\"><b>«Чат программы»</b> — можно общаться на любые темы: выкладывать анонсы мероприятий, обсуждать книги, делиться проектами и искать единомышленников, организовывать различные активности и т.д.</p>",
          "settings": {
            "anchor": "",
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "78646a9d-076d-4037-a258-45ecf2d28a88",
          "type": "image",
          "label": "Изображение",
          "title": "",
          "images": [
            {
              "id": 11369,
              "url": "https://u.netology.ru/backend/uploads/lms/assets/2026/4/11369/file/2e70682b-454c-42de-b7ee-a83bacf2335e.jpg"
            }
          ],
          "settings": {
            "width": 70,
            "anchor": "",
            "border": false,
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b20d0df6-8cc5-43ef-ab33-a51b54bffbee",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Текст",
          "value": "<p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;14pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;serif&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;}]}\" pm-open-left=\"1\">Также в процессе обучения координатор будет создавать отдельные чаты по дисциплинам для общения с преподавателями. Их расположение показано на скриншоте ниже.</p>",
          "settings": {
            "anchor": "",
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a348c9f2-cbfb-4527-a16a-1e70ac7f69e6",
          "type": "image",
          "label": "Изображение",
          "title": "",
