          }
        },
        {
          "id": "42c55cdc-7e78-40e1-bfd1-065f2690c00f",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Текст",
          "value": "<p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\" pm-open-left=\"1\">В чатах вы сможете:</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\">— общаться друг с другом;</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\">— задавать вопросы координатору и преподавателям.</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#fff001&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\">Для общения в чате или отслеживания сообщений, вам необходимо присоединиться к нему по ссылке, которую координатор разместил на стене сообщества. Далее нажать кнопку «+Присоединиться».</p>",
          "settings": {
            "anchor": "",
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fbc375c3-ddb3-471f-8f9d-c2deb7ac5c56",
          "type": "image",
          "label": "Изображение",
          "title": "",
          "images": [
            {
              "id": 11371,
              "url": "https://u.netology.ru/backend/uploads/lms/assets/2026/4/11371/file/8dcab26b-8b38-4519-a409-03cca4e7334e.jpg"
            }
          ],
          "settings": {
            "width": 50,
            "anchor": "",
            "border": false,
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a76fb384-97b6-4284-a92d-ffc40d3182ca",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Текст",
          "value": "<p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;}]}\" pm-open-left=\"1\"><b>Обратите внимание</b>, если вы присоединитесь к чату из списка чатов или меню сообщества, то сможете увидеть сообщения только с момента вступления в чат. Если вы присоединитесь к чату по соответствующей ссылке на стене сообщества, то вам будут доступны все сообщения чата и до момента вступления.</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\">После этого все чаты появятся у вас в сообщениях в ВК Мессенджере. Для удобства рекомендуем объединить их в одну папку — так всё будет под рукой.&nbsp;</p><p data-syno-attrs=\"{&quot;textMarks&quot;:[{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_size&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;11pt&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;font_family&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;em&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;background_color&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;superscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;subscript&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false},{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;strike&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:false}]}\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0em;\">При необходимости вы можете настроить уведомления и отключить их в чатах дисциплин, которые уже прошли.</span><br></p>",
          "settings": {
            "anchor": "",
            "indent": 32
          }
        },
